Package: knowledgelayer
Type: Package
Title: A Knowledge Layer and Decision Record for Oversight Analytics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Philippa", "Hawker", email = "hello@philippa.page",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Plain-file tools that sit beside a reproducible analytical
    pipeline and keep what the code alone cannot: which projects exist, who
    holds them, what data and methods they share, and how each review
    decision was made. A shared, 'SKOS'-shaped oversight vocabulary (audit
    concepts, report types, criteria, a findings typology with crosswalks to
    the standards, program areas) connects work described in different
    words, and an office extends it with its own terms. Four further parts:
    a project registry with links between projects and a single-point-of-
    knowledge check; a capability checklist adapted from the UK Local
    Government Association's LG Inform Plus, for measuring a jurisdiction's
    public data infrastructure; a human review page whose exported verdicts
    gate the next pipeline step, with a check for rubber-stamped reviews;
    and an append-only, hash-chained decision log that gives an audit trail
    even where no version control system is in place.
